+  // Hades: where a correction of a passthrough stream lands (RawLanded(), RawLandingMs()): as close
+  // to the video as its sound can be put: a pause is as long as the error, so ahead it lands within a
+  // millisecond; a packet is left out whole, so behind it lands within half a packet (TrueHD 10 ms,
